@{
    Layout = null;
    ViewData["Title"] = "12 Week Recomp — Concept Lab";
}
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
    <title>12 Week Recomp — Concept Lab</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/welcome-lab-v1012.css" asp-append-version="true" />
</head>
<body class="wl-page">
<header class="wl-topbar">
    <a class="wl-brand" href="/welcome-lab">12 WEEK <em>RECOMP</em></a>
    <a class="wl-back" href="/welcome-ignite">← Ignite</a>
    <a class="wl-cta-mini" href="/recomp/start">Create Free Account</a>
</header>
<main class="wl-lab">
    <section class="wl-lab-intro">
        <div>
            <p class="wl-kicker">WELCOME EXPERIENCE LAB · TEST ONLY</p>
            <h1>FOUR WAYS TO <span>BREAK FREE.</span></h1>
            <p>These are four visual entry experiences. Every concept now leads to the same four simple destinations: understand Recomp, see how the system works, inspect the evidence, or build your individualized account.</p>
            <div class="wl-guide-links">
                <a href="/recomp/what">What is Recomp?</a>
                <a href="/recomp/how">How it Works</a>
                <a href="/recomp/evidence">Evidence</a>
                <a class="start" href="/recomp/start">Create Free Account</a>
            </div>
        </div>
        <a class="wl-crest" href="/recomp/what" aria-label="Open What Is Recomp" style="padding:0;background:#000;display:block;">
            <img src="/images/recomp/12wr-unbound-crest-v1012.jpg" alt="12 Week Recomp — Unbound, Energized, Alive" style="display:block;width:100%;height:100%;min-height:360px;object-fit:contain;background:#000;" />
        </a>
    </section>

    <div class="wl-lab-grid">
        <a class="wl-lab-card" href="/welcome-lab/break-free">
            <span class="tag">Concept A · Full-screen poster</span>
            <h2>BREAK FREE</h2>
            <p>One image. One message. Motion, glow, parallax and almost no explanation.</p>
            <span class="arrow">↗</span>
        </a>
        <a class="wl-lab-card" href="/welcome-lab/hotspots">
            <span class="tag">Concept B · Clickable image world</span>
            <h2>EXPLORE YOUR SYSTEM</h2>
            <p>The image is the interface. Four draggable hotspots now open the four real public guide pages.</p>
            <span class="arrow">◎</span>
        </a>
        <a class="wl-lab-card" href="/welcome-lab/cards">
            <span class="tag">Concept C · Draggable cards</span>
            <h2>BUILD YOUR STACK</h2>
            <p>Four visual cards. Reorder them, then open What, How, Evidence or Start.</p>
            <span class="arrow">↕</span>
        </a>
        <a class="wl-lab-card" href="/welcome-lab/ascend">
            <span class="tag">Concept D · Borderless cinematic</span>
            <h2>ASCEND</h2>
            <p>No boxed layout. The photograph owns the screen while the key paths remain one click away.</p>
            <span class="arrow">→</span>
        </a>
    </div>
</main>
</body>
</html>